OL,3,GNEWSAReform's Joe Martin threatens     
OL,4,Alegal challenge after being banned from
OL,5,Aspeaking in Senedd                     
OL,7,FA Reform UK politician banned from     
OL,8,Fspeaking in the Senedd after referring 
OL,9,Fto the "replacement" of white people in
OL,10,Fthe UK says he will seek legal action  
OL,11,Fto overturn the decision.              
OL,13,FJoe Martin said elected representatives
OL,14,Fshould be able to "speak up for the    
OL,15,Fpeople who elected them" and raise     
OL,16,F"difficult subjects".                  
OL,18,FReform ended a two-week boycott of most
OL,19,FSenedd proceedings on Tuesday in       
OL,20,Fresponse to the ban, and failed in a   
OL,21,Fbid to remove the parliament's         
OL,22,Fpresiding officer                      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
