OL,5,Aspeaking in Senedd                     
OL,7,FThe Free Speech Union (FSU) campaign   
OL,8,Fgroup said Huw Irranca-Davies' ruling  
OL,9,Fbreached European law, and has sent a  
OL,10,Fpre-action letter challenging it.      
